UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|^*BThe 5 level belongs to the opponents^*n is a good rule. It means it is usually incorrect to bid 5 over 5 as this hand illustrates and I would have doubled 5@S since partner opened we want to be in game. So 5@S is clearly a sacrifice and must be doubled. Anyway, an interesting hand with lots of options.|
