UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|This is definitely tricky hand to play. Because Declarer is missing the @HK109, he should realize has a heart loser and there is no reason to take the finesse. Also, Declarer needs to be worried about spade ruffs.|
PG| ***** 26 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|So after winning the opening trick he needs to play the @HA and a low heart to dummy removing @HK10 of trumps. Then he can then play diamonds and clubs making 2.|
PG| ***** 27 ***** |


