Hand 3
https://tinyurl.com/248xq9kl
qx|A3|st||rh||ah|Board 3 IMPs   -   May 15, 2024|pn|hondo717,Honeydog3,aspiring,Toasterln|
md|1SJT54HKQJ4DAQ8CA4,SA862HA93DT93CT83,SKHT72DK6CKQJ7652,SQ973H865DJ7542C9|sv|e|MB|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I am going to open 1N, but Marty Bergen would say I am too strong to do so. He would add 1 point for the quality heart suit and say my hand is worth 18. If I had two extra Bergen evaluation points (such as a quality suit and a 5-card suit), I will upgrade the hand and open 1@D intending to rebid 2N, treating a 17 point hand like that as 18-19. But with only one |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=bergenstartingpoints,Bergen Starting Points^*N|CP||FP||at| upgrade I play it straight and open 1N.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow the link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
PG| ***** 29 ***** |


mb|1N|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|MB|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|North has good reason to think 6@C has good plays. But needs to worry about our not having enough aces with an aceless hand. As North, I bid 3@C that I play as slam try. Then if partner likes clubs, which South does in this auction, can start control bidding.|
PG| ***** 30 ***** |


mb|3C|mb|P|mb|3D|mb|P|mb|3S|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|P|MB|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Here I am going to bid 4@D RKCB. I play |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=kickback,Kickback^*N|CP||FP||at|. When clubs are trump, 4@D is RKCB. Even if you don't play it over the minors, I strongly suggest you use 4@S as RKCB when hearts are trump as that is very straight forward. I have a lesson about Kickback RKCB on my web site.|
PG| ***** 31 ***** |


mb|4D|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|4S|an|1 or 4 Key Cards|
