mb|4H|mb|P|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I 100% agree with East pass although she has an opening hand, it is flat and she also has no good bid. A double is not takeout or penalty per se. It is ^*BCard Showing^*n. It tells partner to ^*BDo Something Intelligent.^*B|
