nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Often partner will pass with a defensive trick or two or a balanced hand. Partner may bid with an unbalanced hand with 2 aces and a king. East is close to a card showing double but I like pass best.|
